\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The instrument shall be a Source Four Zoom ellipsoidal spotlight as manufactured by Electronic Theatre Controls, Inc., or approved equal. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s3 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 B.\tab}}\pard\plain \s3\ql \fi-720\li1728\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1530\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl2\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin1728\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Physical
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
The unit shall be constructed of rugged, die cast aluminum and extruded aluminum, free of burrs and pits, finished in black, high temperature epoxy paint. Tools shall not be required for either lamp alignment. A Phillips head screwdriver shall be required
 for cleaning the reflector. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2.\tab}The following shall be provided:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 a.\tab}}\pard\plain \s5\ql \fi-576\li2736\ri0\sb120\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2736\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl4\outlinelevel4\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {15\'ba -30\'ba or 25\'ba - 50\'ba field angle range
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 b.\tab}}\pard \s5\ql \fi-576\li2736\ri0\sb120\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2736\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl4\outlinelevel4\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0 {
Bind free one hand zoom angle/focus adjustment and locking dial with field angle indicators
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 c.\tab}Scale markings on lens tube
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 d.\tab}Insulated rear handle
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 e.\tab}Double clutch fixture body for both 15\'ba - 30\'ba and 25\'ba - 50\'ba version 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 f.\tab}Integral cable clamp for power leads
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 g.\tab}Positive locking of lamp focus and independent lamp alignment controls unaffected by relamping
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 h.\tab}High impact, thermally insulated knobs and shutter handles
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 i.\tab}Reflector secured with shock mounts
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 j.\tab}Rotating shutter assembly  - 50\'ba rotation
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 k.\tab}20 gauge stainless steel shutters
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 l.\tab}Interchangeable / retrofitable rotating lens tube
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 m.\tab}Lens tube door for easy access to lenses
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 n.\tab}Sturdy gel frame holders with two accessory slots, and a top mounted, quick release electroplated black gel frame retainer
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 o.\tab}Rugged 3/16\'94 x 1-1/4\'94  (4.8mm x 31.8mm) steel yoke with two mounting positions allowing 300\'ba+ rotation of the fixture within the yoke for 25\'ba - 50\'ba version
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 p.\tab}Positive locking, hand operated yoke clutch
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 q.\tab}Slot with sliding cover for motorized pattern devices or optional iris
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s3 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 C.\tab}}\pard\plain \s3\ql \fi-720\li1728\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1530\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl2\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin1728\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Optical
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The optical train shall combine a compact filament lamp with a precision molded borosilicate ellipsoidal refle
ctor and dual Anti-reflection coated precision aspheric lens system to produce a highly efficient optimum cosine field and sharp pattern projection.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2.\tab}The unit shall provide, but not be limited to:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 a.\tab}}\pard\plain \s5\ql \fi-576\li2736\ri0\sb120\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2736\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl4\outlinelevel4\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Molded borosilicate reflector with multiple dichroic layers
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 b.\tab}95% of visible light shall be reflected while 90% of infrared light as heat shall be transmitted through the reflector and removed from the projected beam.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 c.\tab}Low gate and beam temperature
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 d.\tab}Sharp imaging through a three plane shutter design
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 e.\tab}For the 15\'ba - 30\'ba Zoom \endash  Two Bi-convex aspheric lenses with an anti-reflective coating to increase lens transmission
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 f.\tab}For the 25\'ba - 50\'ba Zoom - a plano-convex aspheric front lens with an anti-reflective coating and a Bi-convex aspheric rear lens with an 
anti-reflective coating to increase lens transmission
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s3 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 D.\tab}}\pard\plain \s3\ql \fi-720\li1728\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1530\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl2\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin1728\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Performance
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The unit shall be precision engineered to use an HPL lamp to deliver an even, intense field with cosine distribution.  Nominal field angle cosine field lumen output shall be at least 
7680 lumens for 15\'ba - 30\'ba version and 9060 lumens for 25\'ba - 50\'ba version.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2.\tab}The unit shall be capable of utilizing ETC Dimmer Doubling technology.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 3.\tab}The unit shall provide, but not be limited to:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 a.\tab}}\pard\plain \s5\ql \fi-576\li2736\ri0\sb120\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2736\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl4\outlinelevel4\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {15\'ba - 30\'ba or 25\'ba - 50\'ba field angle range
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 b.\tab}Smooth, easy lens movement and single hand adjustment for simultaneous field angle and focus setting.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 c.\tab}Projector-quality pattern imaging (stainless steel, glass, and rotating patterns)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 d.\tab}Sharp shutter cuts without halation
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 e.\tab}Shutter warping and burnout in normal use shall be unacceptable
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s5 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 f.\tab}Adjustable hard and soft beam edges
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 4.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The unit shall be UL/cUL listed and so labeled.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s3 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 E.\tab}}\pard\plain \s3\ql \fi-720\li1728\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx1530\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl2\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin1728\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Lamps
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s4 \f1\fs20 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s4\ql \fi-432\li2160\ri0\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\ilvl3\outlinelevel3\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0 
\f1\fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The high efficiency lamps shall be an HPL lamp, which shall consist of a compact tungsten filament contained in a krypton-filled 
quartz envelope. The lamp shall mount axially within the reflector. The lamp base shall have an integral die cast aluminum heat sink that reduces seal temperature and ensures proper lamp alignment. The lamp socket shall be ATP 220 nickel gold plated.

\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1 
\par }}